{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "治理与密钥",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 102.74,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "许可链最大的风险，常常在流程里。",
   "spoken": "许可链最大的风险，常常在流程里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.888,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.65
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "第一处，根 CA。",
   "spoken": "第一处，根 CA。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.708,
   "dur": 2.424,
   "speechStart": 5.806,
   "speechEnd": 7.294
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "根私钥放在在线服务器上，一旦被攻破，攻击者就能签发任意身份。",
   "spoken": "根私钥放在在线服务器上，一旦被攻破，攻击者就能签发任意身份。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-02.mp3",
   "start": 8.352,
   "dur": 6.096,
   "speechStart": 8.45,
   "speechEnd": 13.616
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "控制是根 CA 离线，私钥放进 HSM，日常签发交给中间 CA。",
   "spoken": "控制是根 CA 离线，私钥放进 HSM，日常签发交给中间 CA。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-03.mp3",
   "start": 14.668,
   "dur": 6.48,
   "speechStart": 14.766,
   "speechEnd": 20.325
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "节点和管理员的私钥，也放进 HSM 或 KMS。",
   "spoken": "节点和管理员的私钥，也放进 HSM 或 KMS。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.368,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 21.466,
   "speechEnd": 25.442
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "身份 CA 和 TLS CA，也要分开。",
   "spoken": "身份 CA 和 TLS CA，也要分开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.508,
   "dur": 4.416,
   "speechStart": 26.606,
   "speechEnd": 30.07
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "第二处，管理员集中。",
   "spoken": "第二处，管理员集中。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-06.mp3",
   "start": 31.144,
   "dur": 2.616,
   "speechStart": 31.242,
   "speechEnd": 32.92
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "一家技术服务商，替好几家组织拿着管理员证书。",
   "spoken": "一家技术服务商，替好几家组织拿着管理员证书。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.98,
   "dur": 4.848,
   "speechStart": 34.078,
   "speechEnd": 37.994
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "它一出事，好几家就同时失守。",
   "spoken": "它一出事，好几家就同时失守。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.048,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 39.146,
   "speechEnd": 41.574
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "控制是各家自持密钥，服务商只拿受限的运维权限。",
   "spoken": "控制是各家自持密钥，服务商只拿受限的运维权限。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-09.mp3",
   "start": 42.628,
   "dur": 4.992,
   "speechStart": 42.726,
   "speechEnd": 46.785
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "第三处，配置更新和成员退出。",
   "spoken": "第三处，配置更新和成员退出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-10.mp3",
   "start": 47.84,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 47.938,
   "speechEnd": 50.628
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "改通道策略或成员名单，要多家组织签名，变更留痕。",
   "spoken": "改通道策略或成员名单，要多家组织签名，变更留痕。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-11.mp3",
   "start": 51.684,
   "dur": 5.688,
   "speechStart": 51.782,
   "speechEnd": 56.52
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "成员退出时，要吊销证书，修改策略，再评估它手里已经拿到的数据。",
   "spoken": "成员退出时，要吊销证书，修改策略，再评估它手里已经拿到的数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-12.mp3",
   "start": 57.592,
   "dur": 6.72,
   "speechStart": 57.69,
   "speechEnd": 63.475
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "Fabric 文档提醒，成员身份不会自动过期，只能吊销。",
   "spoken": "Fabric 文档提醒，成员身份不会自动过期，只能吊销。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-13.mp3",
   "start": 64.532,
   "dur": 5.064,
   "speechStart": 64.63,
   "speechEnd": 68.761
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "所以吊销流程，要提前演练。",
   "spoken": "所以吊销流程，要提前演练。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-14.mp3",
   "start": 69.816,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 69.914,
   "speechEnd": 72.318
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "第四处，成员共谋。",
   "spoken": "第四处，成员共谋。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-15.mp3",
   "start": 73.372,
   "dur": 2.784,
   "speechStart": 73.47,
   "speechEnd": 75.315
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "达到背书门槛的几家成员，可以写入虚假的业务状态。",
   "spoken": "达到背书门槛的几家成员，可以写入虚假的业务状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-16.mp3",
   "start": 76.376,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 76.474,
   "speechEnd": 80.747
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "对策是外部锚定，定期把账本摘要写到公链，或者交给第三方保存。",
   "spoken": "对策是外部锚定，定期把账本摘要写到公链，或者交给第三方保存。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-17.mp3",
   "start": 81.804,
   "dur": 6.168,
   "speechStart": 81.902,
   "speechEnd": 87.14
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "它能证明历史没被改写，却不能证明数据本身是真的。",
   "spoken": "它能证明历史没被改写，却不能证明数据本身是真的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-18.mp3",
   "start": 88.192,
   "dur": 5.424,
   "speechStart": 88.29,
   "speechEnd": 92.79
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "最后，所有节点放在同一个云账户里，也是单点，要分账户，分地域，分运营方。",
   "spoken": "最后，所有节点放在同一个云账户里，也是单点，要分账户，分地域，分运营方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep30/audio/lines/seg4-19.mp3",
